sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Employer System
    participant C as Verification Service
    participant D as Archive Store
    participant L as Audit Log
    V->>C: POST /v1/verifications (up to 100 refs, one HTTP/2 connection)
    par Each reference, independent stream
        C->>D: Lookup certificate
        D-->>C: Current state + amendment overlay
        C->>C: Apply disclosure projection
        C->>L: Record verification event
    end
    C-->>V: 200, one result per reference
